Imports: magmaanlab (>= 0.2.0), stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), lavaan
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Description: One call estimates a structural equation model and computes
    inference under a single documented policy chosen by magmaan, with lavaan
    model syntax and a few familiar options. Pure R: all computation happens in
    'magmaanlab', the methods-development package over the magmaan C++ core,
    which also offers every alternative convention. Not CRAN-bound.
